# Rust
/target
crates/mdview-desktop/target/

# fgOS work-item state — local tooling, not part of this project.
# events.jsonl is the exception: it is the append-only decision/outcome log,
# the durable record. Everything else here (state.json and the other logs) is
# derived from it or machine-local, so it stays out.
# Must exclude the contents rather than the directory itself: git cannot
# re-include a file inside an excluded directory.
/.fgos/*
!/.fgos/events.jsonl
/.claude/worktrees/
